---
name: Harmony Email & Collaboration events → OCSF
description: |
  Maps Harmony Email & Collaboration security events, as returned by the
  events API or forwarded in the SIEM JSON format, to OCSF.
---

from_file "/path/to/harmony-email-events.ndjson" {
  read_ndjson
}
checkpoint::email::parse
checkpoint::email::ocsf::normalize
